@startuml
title ATM State Machine - Authentication and Withdrawal

[*] --> Idle

Idle --> Authenticate : InsertCard / promptPIN
Authenticate : entry/Prompt user for PIN
Authenticate --> Authenticate : CheckPIN [incorrect] / increment errorCounter
Authenticate --> Authenticate : CheckPIN [correct] / reset errorCounter
Authenticate --> Rejected : CheckPIN [incorrect AND errorCounter >= 3] / ejectCard
Authenticate --> Transaction : CheckPIN [correct]

Transaction : entry/Display options
Transaction --> Withdraw : SelectWithdraw
Transaction --> Exit : Cancel / ejectCard

Withdraw : entry/Prompt for amount
Withdraw --> Closed : RequestAmount [balance == 0] / closeAccount
Withdraw --> Transaction : RequestAmount [balance > 0] / dispenseCash, updateBalance

Closed : entry/Notify user account closed

Exit : entry/Thank user, ejectCard
Exit --> [*]

Rejected : entry/Too many incorrect attempts, ejectCard
Rejected --> [*]
@enduml
